{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are an angler haunted by huge debts. In the midst of yet another night working at sea, you catch something different: a fish which talks, and promises to make you rich... but at what cost?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Short shocking horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brief (around 30 minutes) fishing horror game about debt and hopelessness. Enjoy a twisted cautionary tale in one sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/short_horror.gif?t=1751650897\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Underwater eye-cam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the fish biting the lure, then retrieve it as fast as you can. Be careful though: something else may be watching you as well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/fishing.gif?t=1751650897\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fish and gut</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly-fish like a pro, then gut your catch to keep 'em fresh. Be careful with the knife though: you don't want to cut yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/gutting.gif?t=1751650897\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The talking fish wants a deal</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consider the alluring promises of this mysterious being through surreal dialogues and twisted choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/ciro.gif?t=1751650897\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The loan shark is coming</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no relaxing cozy fishing experience. Your time is running out, and something horrible lurks in the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/shark_appears.gif?t=1751650897\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751730?t=1751650897","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751730?t=1751650897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/3f22860a6bd06f389cc0709d6948c0a172ef8d64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751650897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/3f22860a6bd06f389cc0709d6948c0a172ef8d64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751650897","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains mild references to physical self-harm which may be disturbing to some players."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3826130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are an angler haunted by huge debts. In the midst of yet another night working at sea, you catch something different: a fish which talks, and promises to make you rich... but at what cost?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Short shocking horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brief (around 30 minutes) fishing horror ga